      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "同底数的两个幂的积，等于这个底数的幂，指数等于两个",
        "幂的指数的和．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "可以证明，当几个幂相乘时，这个性质仍然成立．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，当三个幂相乘时，有",
        "$a^ma^na^k=(a^ma^n)a^k=a^{m+n}a^k=a^{m+n+k}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在作变形时，应用下面的法则比较方便："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "同底数的幂相乘，底数不变，幂指数相加．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "569",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "569．把积写成幂的形式：",
        "а) $a^5a^3$；　　б) $x^{10}x^8$；　　в) $b^{21}b^{39}$；　　г) $c^{68}c^{41}$；",
        "д) $2^6\\cdot2^4$；　　е) $7^5\\cdot7$；　　ж) $5^8\\cdot25$；　　з) $3^{12}\\cdot27$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "570",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "570．把幂写成两个幂的积的形式（任意写一种）：",
        "а) $x^{10}$；　　б) $y^{15}$；　　в) $2^{12}$；　　г) $5^{17}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "571",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "571．把积写成幂的形式：",
        "а) $x^2x^5x^4$；　　　　　　　　　б) $y^5y^2y$；",
        "в) $10^2\\cdot10^3\\cdot10^5$；　　　　　г) $17^6\\cdot17^8\\cdot17$；",
        "д) $(2y)^3\\cdot(2y)^2$；　　　　　　　е) $(10ab)^2\\cdot(10ab)^4$；",
        "ж) $x^nx^2$，其中$n\\in N$；　　　　　з) $5^m\\cdot5^3$，其中$m\\in N$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "572",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "572．把下列各式写成底数$c$的幂的形式：",
        "а) $(c^4)^3$；　　　　　　　б) $(c^2)^4$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "573",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "573．把下列各式写成底数$2$的幂的形式，并查表求各式",
        "的值：",
        "а) $2^5\\cdot2^3$；　　б) $2^6\\cdot4$；　　в) $8\\cdot2^7$；　　г) $16\\cdot32$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "574",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "574．把下列各式写成底数$5$的幂的形式：",
        "а) $5^n\\cdot5$，$n\\in N$；　　　　　　б) $5^{n+1}\\cdot25$，$n\\in N$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "575",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "575．用底数$c$的幂代替$x$，使所得等式当变量$c$取所有值时"
      ]
    },
